'' What 'var p( ) = ...' and a returned fixed local still refuse. 'var p( )' takes only an array
'' result -- anything else stays TKO0612, fbc's error 75 -- and only a plain, uninitialised local
'' fixed array becomes dynamic to be returned: a STATIC one, or one with an initialiser, is still
'' TKO0838. See symbols/resolvearr.tiko ReturnedLocalArray_ and symbols/arrresult.tiko.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/array-result-fixed-errors.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-fixed-errors.tiko(5,5): error TKO0612: var-len array 'b' cannot be initialized
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-fixed-errors.tiko(4,5): error TKO0612: var-len array 'a' cannot be initialized
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-fixed-errors.tiko(7,5): error TKO0612: var-len array 'c' cannot be initialized
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-fixed-errors.tiko(10,5): error TKO0838: this function returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-fixed-errors.tiko(14,5): error TKO0838: this function returns an array
